4. **Header and docs.** Update the comment header of `e2e.mjs` (lines 28-31 describe the modes) with the rule in two sentences (names, refuse/remove). `web/README.md` and `web/e2e/live-api-preconditions.mjs` also state the premise: **they are not yours**; list each place that names the runner's environment (`git grep -n -i -E 'HPSM_API_DEV_AUTH|default caller|E2E_LIVE_API_MARKER' <main sha> -- .`) under FOR TUESDAY.
